      "id": "decisions-23-27",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -210,
      "w": 520,
      "text": "Curated registry as service state.\nDecisions 23, 24, 27, 28, 31 \u2014 Postgres source of truth, KV write-through cache, server-assigned revision, config-level origin allowlist (SRI deferred to Phase 6), audited writes whose actor is the shared admin identity (BR-AS23)."
    },
    {
      "id": "decisions-25-26",
      "x": 2040,
      "y": -210,
      "w": 520,
      "text": "BR-AS19 / decisions 25 and 26.\nAn addition is indexed live; a removal or URL change is offered as a reload. Nothing active is ever torn down."
    },
    {
      "id": "decision-18-20",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2370,
      "w": 520,
      "text": "The two write refusals the design creates: BR-AS18 optimistic concurrency, BR-AS20 origin allowlist. Both refuse rather than merge or defer."
    }
  ],
